# Server Stats (Go)

A simple CLI tool written in Go to display basic Linux/Windows server performance stats.

## Features

- CPU usage
- Memory usage (with GB conversion)
- Disk usage
- Top 5 processes by CPU
- Top 5 processes by memory

## Requirements

- Go 1.23+
- Linux, macOS, or Windows

## Install

```bash
git clone https://github.com/navaparvaz/server-stats-go.git
cd server-stats-go
go mod tidy
```

## Usage

```bash
go run main.go
```

Or build and run:

```bash
go build -o server-stats
./server-stats
```

